{
  "description": "Declared critical paths for the shipping product. Every `via` entry must exist on disk (checked by the harness, invariant CP-01). `plane` records where the hop can be verified: linux = Cloud/CI, apple = M4 runner only, external = hosted platform (unverifiable from this repo).",
